       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.    SWI50106.
      ******************************************************************
      *     PROGRAMA SWI50106.                                    *
      *                                                                *
      *     Consulta de Mensagens
      ******************************************************************
      *     LOG ALTERACOES:                                            *
      *   USER     / DATA     /   REFERENCIA / OBSERVACOES             *
      *                                                                *
      *                                                                *
      ******************************************************************
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       DATA DIVISION.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       01  FILLER                          PIC X(40) VALUE
           'INICIO WORKING-STORAGE SWI50106         '.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            DECLARACOES DE DB2
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE SWCD8101 END-EXEC.
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE SQLCA    END-EXEC.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            MENSAGEM DE INPUT E  OUTPUT
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       COPY SWCV5010.
       COPY SWCV5011.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            AREAS DE TRABALHO
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       COPY ETCL0002.
       COPY VIAL0010.
       COPY VIAL0015.
       COPY VIAW0005.
       COPY VIAK0001.
       COPY VIAK0002.
       COPY SWCK0001.
       COPY SWCK0002.
      *

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            CONSTANTES
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       01  WS-CONSTANTES.
           05 CON-SWVT8101 PIC X(08) VALUE 'SWVT8101'.

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            PROGRAM CONTROL
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       01  WS-PROGRAM-CONTROL.
           05 WS-PROGNAME     PIC  X(08) VALUE 'SWI50106'.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       01  FILLER                        PIC X(40) VALUE
           'FIM DA WORKING-STORAGE SWI50106         '.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       LINKAGE SECTION.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       COPY VIAL0004.
      *
            EXEC SQL INCLUDE VIAP0009 END-EXEC.
      *
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            0000-MAINLINE
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       0000-MAINLINE.
      *
           PERFORM 1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA
              THRU 1099-INICIO-PROGRAMA-EXIT.

           PERFORM 2000-PROC-PROGRAMA
              THRU 2099-PROC-PROGRAMA-EXIT.

           PERFORM 3000-FINAL-PROGRAMA
              THRU 3099-FINAL-PROGRAMA-EXIT.
      *
       0099-MAINLINE-EXIT.
           COPY VIAP0004.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA.
      *
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           MOVE VIAL0001-MENSAGEM-INPUT    TO SWCV5010-MSG.
           MOVE SWCV5010-ASE               TO SWCV5011-ASE.
      *
       1099-INICIO-PROGRAMA-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            2000-PROC-PROGRAMA
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       2000-PROC-PROGRAMA.
      *
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2000-PROC-PROGRAMA' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           MOVE SWCV5010-ADE               TO SWCV5011-ADE.

           PERFORM 2100-VALIDACOES
              THRU 2199-VALIDACOES-EXIT

           IF VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
             IF SWCV5011-ILIDO NOT = SWCK0002-SIM
               PERFORM 2200-MODIFICA-DADOS
                  THRU 2299-MODIFICA-DADOS-EXIT
             END-IF
           END-IF.

       2099-PROC-PROGRAMA-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *                   2100-VALIDACOES
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       2100-VALIDACOES.
      *
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2100-VALIDACOES' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           CONTINUE.

       2199-VALIDACOES-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *                   2200-MODIFICA-DADOS
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       2200-MODIFICA-DADOS.
      *
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2200-MODIFICA-DADOS' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              MOVE 'SWCV5010-CPERFILU' TO VIAL0015-CAMPO-NM(1)
              MOVE  SWCV5010-CPERFILU  TO VIAL0015-CAMPO-VLR(1)
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           MOVE SWCV5010-CCHAVE
             TO SWCD8101-CCODMSG
           MOVE SWCV5010-ZMSGORD
             TO SWCD8101-ZMSGORD
           MOVE 'S'
             TO SWCD8101-ILIDO
           MOVE VIAL0001-CUTILIZA-I
             TO SWCD8101-CUSERID
           MOVE SWCV5010-HTIMEST
             TO SWCD8101-HTIMEST
           MOVE SWCV5010-CPERFILU
             TO SWCD8101-CPERFIL

           EXEC SQL
              SET :SWCD8101-HTIMEST = CURRENT_TIMESTAMP
           END-EXEC.


           EXEC SQL
                 UPDATE
                SWVT8101
                SET
                       ILIDO = :SWCD8101-ILIDO ,
                       HTIMEST = :SWCD8101-HTIMEST ,
                       CUSERID = :SWCD8101-CUSERID ,
                       CPERFIL = :SWCD8101-CPERFIL
                 WHERE
                    CCODMSG = :SWCD8101-CCODMSG
                     AND ZMSGORD = :SWCD8101-ZMSGORD
           END-EXEC


           MOVE CON-SWVT8101               TO VIAL0002-TABLE-NAME.

           PERFORM 9020-DB2CHECK
              THRU 9029-DB2CHECK-EXIT.

           IF VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
              IF DB2-NOTFND
                 MOVE VIAK0002-ERROS-FUNCAO
                   TO VIAL0002-IND-ERROS
                    MOVE SWCK0002-STATUS-ACTIVO
                      TO SWCV5011-CCHAVE-S
                    MOVE SWCK0001-CCODMSG-N-EXISTS
                      TO SWCV5011-CCHAVE-MSG
                    MOVE SWCK0002-CAPLIC
                      TO SWCV5011-CCHAVE-CAPLIC
              ELSE
                 IF NOT DB2-OK
                    MOVE VIAK0002-ABEND-DB2
                      TO VIAL0002-IND-ERROS
                    MOVE VIAK0001-ERRO-DB2
                      TO VIAL0002-COD-ERRO-GRAVE
                 END-IF
              END-IF
           ELSE
              MOVE VIAK0002-ABEND-DB2
                TO VIAL0002-IND-ERROS
              MOVE VIAK0001-ERRO-DB2
                TO VIAL0002-COD-ERRO-GRAVE
           END-IF.

           IF VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
             MOVE SWCD8101-CUSERID TO SWCV5011-CUSERID
             MOVE SWCD8101-CPERFIL TO SWCV5011-CPERFIL
             MOVE SWCD8101-HTIMEST TO SWCV5011-HTIMEST
             MOVE SWCD8101-ILIDO   TO SWCV5011-ILIDO
           END-IF.

       2299-MODIFICA-DADOS-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            3000-FINAL-PROGRAMA
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       3000-FINAL-PROGRAMA.
      *
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '3000-FINAL-PROGRAMA' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           MOVE SWCV5011-MSG               TO VIAL0001-MENSAGEM-OUTPUT.
           MOVE SWCV5011-LENGTH            TO VIAL0001-LENGTH-MSG.
           MOVE SWCV5011-NR-CAMPOS         TO VIAL0001-NR-CAMPOS.
           MOVE ZEROES
             TO VIAL0001-OCORRENCIAS.

       3099-FINAL-PROGRAMA-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE VIAP0003 END-EXEC.
      *==============================================================
           COPY VIAP0010.
           COPY VIAP0016.
